 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Mitsugare Hime to Reigen no Hakurou Ou Kemonohito no Bannouyaku ni Naru no wa Iyananode Zenryoku de Toubou shimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "貢がれ姫と冷厳の白狼王　獣人の万能薬になるのは嫌なので全力で逃亡します"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Nina, a girl who was raised in the forest by her “master,” a former knight of the Holy Kingdom of Arcandia, was suddenly attacked and kidnapped by an emissary from the neighboring country of Uruzgand on the day of her 15th birthday.\nConfused, Nina opens a letter she received from her master.\nIn the letter, Nina learns that she is the princess of the “Sacred Kingdom of Arcandia\".\nIn addition, the blood of the saint born into the royal family of Arcandia will give great power to the beastmen.\nYes, Nina was paid tribute to the ruthless and inhumane White Wolf King Volga for the sake of her country.\nAfter that, Nina tries to escape from Volga many times, but then she learns the true purpose of his kidnapping of Nina...?",
   "ja": "元アルカンディア神聖王国の騎士として活躍していた「師匠」に森の中で育てられていた少女・ニーナは、\n15歳の誕生日を迎えたある日、隣国ウルズガンドの使者から突然襲撃を受け、攫われてしまった。\nニーナは混乱しつつも、師匠から受け取った1通の手紙を開く。\nそこにはニーナが「アルカンディア神聖王国」の姫であるという事実が書かれていた。\n加えて、アルカンディア王家に生まれる聖女の血肉は、獣人に大きな力を与えるということも――。\nそう、ニーナは国のために、冷酷非道な白狼王・ヴォルガに貢がれたのだ。\nその後ニーナは、何度もヴォルガのもとから逃亡を試みるが、そのうちニーナを攫った本当の目的を知り…？"
  },
